  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "The short answer",
      "items": [
        "Route handlers call guards and services",
        "services call the audit chain and the DataStore port",
        "the port builds one adapter, and only the Prisma adapter reaches PostgreSQL"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Not shown here",
      "items": [
        "The guards, the audit chain every service calls in the same transaction as its change, the other services (same layer, same rule) and the .data/store.json file",
        "Connected but out of scope: Browser UI, Microsoft Teams, Edge proxy, Auth.js sessions, Context and guards, API key service"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Constraints",
      "items": [
        "Only the DataStore port and the database blob store reach the Prisma adapter: services depend on the port so persistence swaps with one environment variable; the one recorded exception is databaseBlob.ts, which imports the Prisma client directly"
      ]
    }
  ]
